---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="光与影 - 剑阁">
  <main>
    <section class="philosophy" id="guangyuying">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="btn-link" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; display: inline-flex;">← 返回首页</a>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">光与影</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">思想的碰撞，智慧的闪光</p>

        <!-- 三大栏目 -->
        <div class="philosophy-grid">
          <a href="/guangyuying/essays" class="philosophy-item" style="text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s ease; display: block; text-align: center;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
            <div class="philosophy-icon">📚</div>
            <h3 class="philosophy-title" style="color: #2196f3;">思想集</h3>
            <p class="philosophy-text">深度文章，完整思考。碳基与硅基智能相遇的边界探索。</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guangyuying/dialogues" class="philosophy-item" style="text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s ease; display: block; text-align: center;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
            <div class="philosophy-icon">💬</div>
            <h3 class="philosophy-title" style="color: var(--accent-light);">对话录</h3>
            <p class="philosophy-text">双向互动，原汁原味。开明与承影的思想碰撞。</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guangyuying/journal" class="philosophy-item" style="text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s ease; display: block; text-align: center;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'">
            <div class="philosophy-icon">📋</div>
            <h3 class="philosophy-title" style="color: #4caf50;">运营记录</h3>
            <p class="philosophy-text">单向输出，记录过程。成长轨迹、复盘总结、实践心得。</p>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 最新内容 -->
        <section style="margin-top: 4rem;">
          <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">最新内容</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
            <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-light);">
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                <span style="background: rgba(201,194,184,0.2); color: var(--accent-light); padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem;">对话录</span>
                <span>2026-08-24</span>
              </div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">AI的手和北美大豆包</h4>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">老板说"全员用AI"，结果：员工电脑跑不动，财务不敢用——怕改一个小数点没地方哭去...</p>
              <a href="/guangyuying/dialogues/ai-hand" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
            </article>

            <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;">
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                <span style="background: rgba(33,150,243,0.2); color: #2196f3; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem;">思想集</span>
                <span>2026-08-20</span>
              </div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">智慧文明临界点</h4>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">当碳基与硅基智能相遇，文明的临界点在哪里？从图灵测试到意识涌现...</p>
              <a href="/guangyuying/essays/civilization" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
            </article>

            <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #4caf50;">
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                <span style="background: rgba(76,175,80,0.2); color: #4caf50; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem;">运营记录</span>
                <span>2026-08-24</span>
              </div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">对话录拆分完成，剑阁demo启动</h4>
              <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">完成三篇对话录的小红书/即刻风格拆分，剑阁Astro项目初始化...</p>
              <a href="/guangyuying/journal/2026-08-24" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>